# Redis Engineering

A daily hands-on Redis learning journey focused on building practical backend engineering challenges.

## Topics

- Redis Data Types
- TTL & Expiration
- Caching
- Pub/Sub
- Queues
- Rate Limiting
- Distributed Systems Concepts

